## Read the status {% #status %}

The {% ui key="client:module.status" /%} card on the module page tells you what the plugin is doing now:

- **Every target is met.** The bot waits until a stock drops below its target.
- **No tool targets are set.** Add a row to one of the tables and save.
- **No castle has the workshop that builds** the tool. Build the right workshop, or pick another tool.
- **The level of** the tool **you picked is not unlocked yet.** Unlock it in the game, or pick a tool you can build.
- **Not enough resources to build** the tool. The bot waits until the castle has resources above your floor.
- **The workshop queue is full.** The bot waits for a free slot.

## Related errors {% #errors %}

- [PLUGIN_OPTION_CASTLE](/errors/#plugin-option-castle) means a row names a castle that isn't on this account.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_ITEM](/errors/#plugin-option-item) means a row names a tool that isn't in the list.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_ROWS](/errors/#plugin-option-rows) means a table has too many rows.
